From u185f4d4fdb048fb8 at groups.google.com  Wed Jul  1 15:22:22 2009
From: u185f4d4fdb048fb8 at groups.google.com (Henrik Bengtsson)
Date: Wed, 01 Jul 2009 15:22:22 +0000
Subject: Re: [aroma.affymetrix] question on R.oo/R.methodsS3
Message-ID: <00kE5zeQsPo.4zZ18vPQ8XAJ@aroma-affymetrix.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <00kE5zeQsPo.9vAMYy0RVr0J@aroma-affymetrix.groups.google.com>
References: <00kE5zeQsPo.9vAMYy0RVr0J@aroma-affymetrix.groups.google.com>
