Dear Aroma team,

I enjoyed using the MAT implementation in aroma, but now I wonder how to best proceed for calling of enriched regions? Are there any functions / scripts available?

Secondly, do you plan to implement further functions for tiling arrays, in particular for transcript discovery (which is  similar to identifying chip-chip regions but involves discrete steps between signal and no-signal regions) and for detection of differential splicing?

Thank you very much for your help.

Best wishes,

Lars

