Bonjour Mathieu.

A few comments below.

On 30/07/2009, at 4:35 AM, Mathieu wrote:

>
> Salut !!
>
> I am analysing  rat exon arrays from Affymetrix with Aroma.Affymetrix
> (sessionInfo() bellow).
